{"ReactionTitle":{"value":"Nicotinamide + H2O <=> Nicotinate + NH3","type":"literal"},"compound":{"value":"http://bio2rdf.org/cpd:C00153","type":"uri"},"ChemicalEquation":{"value":"C00153 + C00001 <=> C00253 + C00014","type":"literal"},"drug":{"value":"http://www4.wiwiss.fu-berlin.de/drugbank/resource/drugs/DB02701","type":"uri"},"drugDesc":{"value":"An important compound functioning as a component of the coenzyme NAD. Its primary significance is in the prevention and/or cure of blacktongue and pellagra. Most animals cannot manufacture this compound in amounts sufficient to prevent nutritional deficiency and it therefore must be supplemented through dietary intake. [PubChem]","type":"literal"}},
